From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seabraid <seabraid@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Strata: opt in to the private Seabraid Qwen decode tier

Target: the Strata commit pinned in compat/strata/patches/strata/STRATA_BASE (its one owner) with the Seabraid compatibility patches 0001-0006 and 0010-0016 applied (0007 was only the wire header, now adapters/strata/wire; 0008 and 0009 dropped: the DeepSeek engine they extend was removed upstream in 0.2.14).
Retain serial request-local failure handling and bind the helper to the engine checkpoint.
